      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A tip revealing a security breach in India's 2026 medical entrance exam exposed the wholesale duplication of the examination's intellectual output. The testing agency received this evidence via email, which showed PDFs matching the chemistry paper. This disclosure led to the recall of a fundamentally compromised work and the scheduling of a new, untainted creation on June 21. The incident underscores a systemic failure in the production of high-stakes assessments, prompting immediate remedial action.",
