    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Following the scheduled date of the medical entrance test, a credible tip was received by the administering institution, triggering a referral of its own subject matter experts for external investigation. This enforcement action resulted in arrests made as part of the investigation, holding those involved accountable for the breakdown in the exam's creation. The event highlights the collapse of a corrupt production pipeline, forcing a rescheduled event and underscoring the human cost of such creative fraud.",
